The '''Path of Scabaras''' in [[Tombs of Amascut]] leads to [[Kephri]], the guardian of [[Scabaras]]. If another path has been entered, the scarab is removed to show that another path is currently being attempted. After the path of Scabaras is cleared, the fire disappears. 

